WEBVTT

1
00:58:08.010 --> 00:58:14.010
You are wonderfully good, Lord. We love you. We hold you dear. We worship you, Jesus.

2
00:58:14.010 --> 00:58:18.010
Thank you that you are our God. Hallelujah.

3
00:58:18.010 --> 00:58:23.010
Thank you, worship team, for always leading us in such great worship.

4
00:58:23.010 --> 00:58:29.010
Thank you, congregation, for your heart that goes out to God and for worshiping Him.

5
00:58:29.010 --> 00:58:32.010
This is so precious. Hallelujah.

6
00:58:33.010 --> 00:58:38.010
You, special one, have been here on stage worshiping God for more than thirty years.

7
00:58:38.010 --> 00:58:42.010
You have been faithful to Him through it all.

8
00:58:42.010 --> 00:58:48.010
So precious. You have been faithful in little. In much He will entrust you.

9
00:58:48.010 --> 00:58:52.010
And you are welcome at the great feast when Jesus returns.

10
00:58:54.010 --> 00:59:01.010
But that applies just as much to you. If you love God and seek Him and worship Him,

11
00:59:01.010 --> 00:59:04.010
you are welcome. Hallelujah.

12
00:59:05.010 --> 00:59:07.010
Hallelujah.

13
00:59:07.010 --> 00:59:09.010
Hallelujah.

14
00:59:09.010 --> 00:59:11.010
I love you, Jesus.

15
00:59:11.010 --> 00:59:21.010
If you have been coming here for a while, you probably know that we talk about money every week.

16
00:59:21.010 --> 00:59:24.010
That we talk about giving every week.

17
00:59:24.010 --> 00:59:27.010
And I am going to do that again now.

18
00:59:27.010 --> 00:59:34.010
And we do not do this because we are out to become as rich as possible at your expense.

19
00:59:34.010 --> 00:59:40.010
Because we are doing well as a church and you can figure it out as long as you give a lot.

20
00:59:40.010 --> 00:59:42.010
That is not what it is about at all.

21
00:59:42.010 --> 00:59:48.010
Moreover, the Bible says that our giving must be out of joy.

22
00:59:48.010 --> 00:59:52.010
Out of gratitude to God. It must never be done reluctantly.

23
00:59:52.010 --> 00:59:54.010
It must never be forced.

24
00:59:54.010 --> 01:00:00.010
So if we were to stand here and proclaim something to brainwash you

25
01:00:00.010 --> 01:00:08.010
or to pressure you into giving as much as possible, we would simply be going against the Bible.

26
01:00:08.010 --> 01:00:11.010
And yet we talk about it every week.

27
01:00:11.010 --> 01:00:17.010
Why? Because giving is such a precious thing in God's kingdom.

28
01:00:17.010 --> 01:00:24.010
When you give, you honor God. When you give, your heart moves towards God.

29
01:00:24.010 --> 01:00:33.010
When you give, His kingdom is built. When you give, you are also blessed, mind you.

30
01:00:33.010 --> 01:00:42.010
And I remember, I had not been converted for long. I was living a poor life.

31
01:00:42.010 --> 01:00:50.010
I was always short on money, had a lot of debts, and things were not going well for me.

32
01:00:50.010 --> 01:00:57.010
But some of you may know, I came to repentance from occultism

33
01:00:57.010 --> 01:01:02.010
and God literally pulled me out of hell and placed me in life.

34
01:01:02.010 --> 01:01:06.010
So when I heard sermons about tithing in the congregation.

35
01:01:06.010 --> 01:01:13.010
Tithing is an abbreviation for one-tenth. One-tenth is ten percent.

36
01:01:13.010 --> 01:01:22.010
And in the congregation, it was explained, when I had just been converted, that God likes it when you dedicate your life to Him.

37
01:01:22.010 --> 01:01:26.010
That God likes it when you dedicate your money to Him.

38
01:01:26.010 --> 01:01:31.010
And that God likes it when you give ten percent of your income.

39
01:01:31.010 --> 01:01:34.010
And I thought, that is impossible.

40
01:01:34.010 --> 01:01:40.010
I am already short on money, how can I give so much? That is just not possible.

41
01:01:40.010 --> 01:01:48.010
But God had pulled me out of that hell and I thought, He has given me my life.

42
01:01:48.010 --> 01:01:52.010
If He wants that, then I will do it and we will see what happens.

43
01:01:52.010 --> 01:01:58.010
And I went to do that and in my case it wasn't immediately that everything turned around completely,

44
01:01:58.010 --> 01:02:01.010
that the debts disappeared in one go.

45
01:02:01.010 --> 01:02:08.010
But gradually it got better and better and my debts began to disappear.

46
01:02:08.010 --> 01:02:13.010
And I started to have money left over instead of running short of money.

47
01:02:13.010 --> 01:02:18.010
And now I am almost forty years further in life, my God.

48
01:02:18.010 --> 01:02:22.010
And God is so good. He blesses me time and again.

49
01:02:22.010 --> 01:02:29.010
I have always remained faithful in radically giving ten percent of all my income to God.

50
01:02:29.010 --> 01:02:31.010
And He has blessed me so much.

51
01:02:31.010 --> 01:02:35.010
And time and again I see miracles happening in the financial realm.

52
01:02:35.010 --> 01:02:40.010
Not only in my own life, but also in many people around me.

53
01:02:40.010 --> 01:02:42.010
So giving is something very wonderful.

54
01:02:42.010 --> 01:02:49.010
For example, there was a man in the church, newly converted, who came to me.

55
01:02:49.010 --> 01:02:53.010
He said, how does this work with tithing?

56
01:02:53.010 --> 01:03:02.010
I wanted to explain it very carefully, because you also don't want to scare someone who just came to church away or something.

57
01:03:02.010 --> 01:03:06.010
No, he says, I just want to know. Tell me what it says.

58
01:03:06.010 --> 01:03:15.010
I said, okay, God wants you to give ten percent so that He can bless you, that He is honored, that His kingdom is built.

59
01:03:15.010 --> 01:03:17.010
That's good, he said, I will do it.

60
01:03:17.010 --> 01:03:23.010
The next morning his boss calls him in and says, I am going to give you a raise.

61
01:03:23.010 --> 01:03:30.010
And that was more than the ten percent he had intended to give to God.

62
01:03:31.010 --> 01:03:36.010
So for me it was very gradual, for him it happened all at once.

63
01:03:36.010 --> 01:03:41.010
I have another young man, who was also deep in debt.

64
01:03:41.010 --> 01:03:47.010
He came to me, saying he couldn't get out anymore, all the bailiffs and everything was going completely wrong.

65
01:03:47.010 --> 01:03:50.010
What advice do you give someone like that?

66
01:03:50.010 --> 01:03:59.010
I said, you need to bring the tithe back to God, because then He can bless you, then He can send the devourer away from your life.

67
01:03:59.010 --> 01:04:07.010
That's radical, but I know, I've seen it so many times, if you are faithful to God in your finances, then He will bless you.

68
01:04:07.010 --> 01:04:11.010
A hard promise, He even says that you may test Him in this.

69
01:04:11.010 --> 01:04:14.010
And that young man took it, he went to do it.

70
01:04:14.010 --> 01:04:21.010
And while he was actually short on money, the following month went well and he came to me.

71
01:04:21.010 --> 01:04:25.010
I don't know what's happening, but things are getting better.

72
01:04:25.010 --> 01:04:27.010
I have no shortage of money.

73
01:04:27.010 --> 01:04:34.010
I'm starting to have some left over and in the months that followed, all the bailiffs disappeared and he got out of debt.

74
01:04:34.010 --> 01:04:36.010
There is God.

75
01:04:36.010 --> 01:04:38.010
God is good.

76
01:04:38.010 --> 01:04:44.010
Another testimony is a woman, who had been here in the church for ten, twenty years.

77
01:04:44.010 --> 01:04:52.010
And she said to me, every time you talk about money, I put my fingers in my ears because I don't want to know.

78
01:04:52.010 --> 01:04:54.010
For ten, twenty years.

79
01:04:54.010 --> 01:04:57.010
And at some point she thought, what am I actually doing?

80
01:04:57.010 --> 01:05:00.010
And she started tithing and she was utterly amazed.

81
01:05:00.010 --> 01:05:03.010
Suddenly it went well and she started to improve.

82
01:05:03.010 --> 01:05:08.010
And two weeks ago, a man from our church told me.

83
01:05:08.010 --> 01:05:13.010
He was in a financial problem, he is in debt, debt mediation.

84
01:05:13.010 --> 01:05:16.010
He only gets a few tens of euros a month to live on.

85
01:05:16.010 --> 01:05:19.010
And he thought, I will still give a tithe.

86
01:05:19.010 --> 01:05:21.010
And he went ahead and did it.

87
01:05:21.010 --> 01:05:24.010
And then suddenly you got thirty percent more.

88
01:05:24.010 --> 01:05:29.010
I don't know how it normally goes in debt mediation, but that seems quite exceptional to me.

89
01:05:29.010 --> 01:05:35.010
There are so many of these testimonies that I have seen come through in my life in this church.

90
01:05:35.010 --> 01:05:39.010
What I, okay the Bible says, the Bible is very clear about it.

91
01:05:39.010 --> 01:05:43.010
But also in practice, I have seen it happen time and again.

92
01:05:43.010 --> 01:05:49.010
So I want to challenge you to think about this, not just to say, it can't be done.

93
01:05:49.010 --> 01:05:52.010
But to trust God and to go ahead and do it.

94
01:05:52.010 --> 01:05:54.010
You know, God is good.

95
01:05:54.010 --> 01:05:56.010
God is God.

96
01:05:56.010 --> 01:05:58.010
God is God.

97
01:05:58.010 --> 01:06:01.010
He determines what happens with his creation.

98
01:06:01.010 --> 01:06:05.010
He made everything, it is his creation, he can do with it what he wants.

99
01:06:05.010 --> 01:06:08.010
Well, we are fortunate that God is good.

100
01:06:08.010 --> 01:06:12.010
Because if God had been bad, he would still be God.

101
01:06:12.010 --> 01:06:17.010
Could he still have enforced how he should handle money, for example?

102
01:06:17.010 --> 01:06:20.010
He could also have said you should give 90%.

103
01:06:20.010 --> 01:06:25.010
He could also have said if you give, you will fall behind, but I want it.

104
01:06:25.010 --> 01:06:29.010
He could also have said if you give, I will not bless you.

105
01:06:29.010 --> 01:06:32.010
But the opposite is true.

106
01:06:32.010 --> 01:06:34.010
God says I am good, I love you.

107
01:06:34.010 --> 01:06:37.010
I do not want you to give and fall behind.

108
01:06:37.010 --> 01:06:40.010
I want you to give and move forward.

109
01:06:40.010 --> 01:06:42.010
I want to bless you.

110
01:06:43.010 --> 01:06:47.010
Dear people, take this seriously.

111
01:06:47.010 --> 01:06:49.010
Giving is something very wonderful.

112
01:06:49.010 --> 01:06:53.010
It seems like it costs you something, but it brings you everything.

113
01:06:53.010 --> 01:06:58.010
And above all, it honors God and brings your heart closer to Him.

