02:06:28.010 --> 02:06:30.010
And speak clearly to our hearts.

718
02:06:31.010 --> 02:06:32.010
Then with a confirmation.

719
02:06:33.010 --> 02:06:35.010
You are doing well, son. You are doing well, daughter.

720
02:06:36.010 --> 02:06:37.010
I tell you, you are stepping.

721
02:06:38.010 --> 02:06:41.010
But if the Lord wants to change our steps, so let it be, Lord.

722
02:06:42.010 --> 02:06:46.010
Your will be done in heaven and in Your name.

723
02:06:47.010 --> 02:06:49.010
In Your own name, I want to say.

724
02:06:50.010 --> 02:06:51.010
In Your personal life.

725
02:06:52.010 --> 02:06:54.010
Your will be done in heaven and in Your personal life.

726
02:06:55.010 --> 02:06:56.010
In the mighty name of Jesus.

727
02:06:56.010 --> 02:06:59.010
And we all say amen. Amen and amen.

728
02:07:00.010 --> 02:07:02.010
Happy Sunday, people. See you tomorrow at the prayer.
